    "Qd8"
   ],
   "spoken": "The queen retreats all the way to d8 — the solid, recently popular system. White simply takes the centre with d4 and develops naturally and actively; there is nothing tricky to fear.",
   "kind": "main",
   "teaches": "Against a passive queen retreat, occupy the centre and develop with purpose.",
   "plans": "d4, natural development, and pressure the space."
