   "line": [
    "h6"
   ],
   "spoken": "The little pawn to h6 is already a mistake — completely unnecessary, a wasted tempo Black cannot afford in an opening where the queen has already been chased. It can be punished by principled play.",
   "kind": "trap",
   "teaches": "An unforced luft like h6 in the opening is a tempo you can punish directly.",
   "plans": "Develop with threats aimed at f7."
